=== Test 10: rejection — string col-vs-col (MIN vs MAX) ===
Expected error: only integer, FLOAT and DOUBLE operands
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CTE_LOOKUP filter col-vs-col: only integer, FLOAT and DOUBLE operands are supported — DECIMAL, string and temporal comparisons need a cast or a constant-vs-column form.
